n do about shots like that."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"53'","type":"assist","side":"away","player":"Mane S.","score":"2:1","text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"54'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Diouf M.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"54'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Jakobs I.","score":null,"text":"The substitution has been made. Ismail Jakobs (Senegal) has replaced El Hadji Malick Diouf."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"54'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Gueye P.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"54'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Mbaye I.","score":null,"text":"Pape Bouna Thiaw decides to make a substitution. Pape Gueye will be replaced by Ibrahim Mbaye (Senegal)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"58'","type":"goal","side":"home","player":"Haaland E.","score":"3:1","text":"Patrick Berg is in a good shooting position, but he sees his teammate and passes the ball to him. Erling Haaland (Norway) takes it nicely and beats the goalkeeper with a precise shot which bounces in off the bar to make the score 3:1."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"58'","type":"assist","side":"home","player":"Berg P.","score":"3:1","text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"63'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Mendy E.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"63'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Diaw M.","score":null,"text":"Edouard Mendy (Senegal) is substituted due to injury. Pape Bouna Thiaw gives a chance to Mory Diaw."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"63'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Camara L.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"63'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Ciss P.","score":null,"text":"Here is a change. Lamine Camara is going off and Pape Bouna Thiaw gives the last tactical orders to Pathe Ciss (Senegal)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"71'","type":"sub_out","side":"home","player":"Nusa A.","score":